{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q333593","formula":"Cu(Mn)₆O₈(SiO₄)","hill":"CuMn6O12Si","elements":["O","Si","Mn","Cu"],"composition":{"O":12.0,"Cu":1.0,"Mn":6.0,"Si":1.0},"names":{"en":"Abswurmbachite","ru":"Абсвюрмбахит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Abswurmbachite is a copper manganese silicate mineral ((Cu,Mn2+)Mn3+6O8SiO4). It was first described in 1991 and named after Irmgard Abs-Wurmbach (born 1938), a German mineralogist. It crystallizes in the tetragonal system.","ru":"Абсвюрмбахи́т — редкий минерал, названный в честь открывшей его Ирмгард Абс-Вюрмбах (р. в 1938), немецкого минералога. Имеет насыщенно-чёрный цвет, тетрагональную сингонию, формулу CuMn6O8(SiO4), чёрный цвет черты, плотность 4,96 г/см3, а также довольно высокую твёрдость по шкале Мооса."},"fame":17,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q333593","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abswurmbachite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D0%B1%D1%81%D0%B2%D1%8E%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%85%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D8%A3%D8%A8%D8%B3%D9%88%D9%8A%D8%B1%D8%A8%D8%B4%D9%8A%D8%AA.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q419605","formula":"Mn₂O₃","names":{"en":"Manganese(III) oxide","ru":"Оксид марганца(III)","uk":"Оксид марганцю(III)"},"elements":["O","Mn"],"fame":26,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q420914","formula":"Mn₂O₃","names":{"en":"Bixbyite","ru":"Биксбиит","uk":"Біксбіїт"},"elements":["O","Mn"],"fame":16,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q3693975","formula":"Pb(Mn₆Mn₂)O